WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.200
A fictional fraud case. Every name, firm and place in it is invented.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:12.200
The app counts 225 people. Four of them are one man.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.200
Sheets are read cell by cell, scans box by box.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.300
One search finds every record that could be him.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:29.200
His ship agent licence writes the name in Arabic: أدريان قصار.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:34.400
No model ran in this demo. The rules alone built the five proposals.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:39.200
They found 4 of the 6 true links between his desks.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:44.200
Here the rules list the surveyor, and a person declines him.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:48.200
A live model declined him too: the places of birth differ.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:54.200
Signing needs the analyst's own passkey, so the film stops at the prompt.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:00.700
Approving the four true links joins all nine of his records.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:07.700
The checker runs in the browser and sends nothing. Shown here on a test package.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:14.700
The app finds the clash by day, not by hour. The times are for a person to read.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:21.700
The picture no longer matches. The sound does.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:28.700
The app does not notice on its own that someone stopped appearing. The statement starts the watch.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:35.700
Every case in this film is fictional.
